Tool response:
Tool: create_share_transfer
Description: Create a new share transfer record.
Initially marks as pending.
Parameters:
    {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "company_id": {
          "type": "integer",
          "title": "Company Id"
        },
        "from_stakeholder_id": {
          "type": "integer",
          "title": "From Stakeholder Id"
        },
        "to_stakeholder_id": {
          "type": "integer",
          "title": "To Stakeholder Id"
        },
        "share_class_id": {
          "type": "integer",
          "title": "Share Class Id"
        },
        "quantity": {
          "type": "integer",
          "title": "Quantity"
        },
        "price_per_share": {
          "type": "number",
          "title": "Price Per Share"
        },
        "effective_date": {
          "type": "string",
          "title": "Effective Date"
        },
        "created_by": {
          "type": "integer",
          "title": "Created By"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "company_id",
        "from_stakeholder_id",
        "to_stakeholder_id",
        "share_class_id",
        "quantity",
        "price_per_share",
        "effective_date",
        "created_by"
      ]
    }

Tool response:
Tool: update_share_transfer_status
Description: Update the status of a share transfer record to approved or settled.
Parameters:
    {
      "type": "object",
      "properties": {
        "id": {
          "type": "integer",
          "title": "Id",
          "description": ""
        },
        "status": {
          "type": "string",
          "title": "Status"
        }
      },
      "required": [
        "id",
        "status"
      ]
    }
